# Page Pulse Scalable Architecture

## Overview

Page Pulse is a production URL auditing service designed to handle:

- 10,000 audits per day
- 500 concurrent request bursts
- Low latency API responses
- Reliable background processing
- Horizontal scalability

The architecture separates the fast API layer from heavy audit processing workloads.

